{"metabox":"1","type":"annotation","subject":"jarl/proofs/engine/Engine/Preserve/Deliver.lean","issuer":"mailto:alex@kesling.co","issuer_type":"ai","created_at":"2026-11-04T15:26:23.933435Z","id":"c5f98c931b299d16b35da9cf66a2b788ec01ad94e8c2845ff603303974c1ffd8","body":{"detail":"The deliver proof needed to know that a Replicate is only queued at peer slots (for outbox_self), which jarl/proofs/engine/Engine/Replicated.lean's replicated_rel does not state, so Deliver.lean reproves the relation as replicated_rel2.","kind":"suggestion","span":{"start":{"line":500},"end":{"line":500},"content_hash":"9bdb9b5fdf8609d111d353a8f50c07142d086e3e057fbe997e1460c1f1717fd7"},"suggested_fix":"Strengthen replicated_rel in Replicated.lean to the replicated_rel2 statement and delete the copy.","summary":"replicated_rel2 duplicates Replicated.lean's replicated_rel with a stronger outbox clause","tags":["session:claude-code:a11d54e5-e61a-4ddb-ada4-de40e3db1dad"]}}
